        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 3477 Contemporary Rectangular Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Contemporary Rectangular Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Made from aluminum, the Pryor Door Handle is available in a huge selection of finishes; and because of its modern appearance, we think that this pull would look stunning in matte black, satin brass, or polished chrome. The 20 Inch Pryor Aluminum Pull has 18 inch mounting centers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-3477-20_size.gif?v=1704442273\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 3477/20 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 20 Inch Modern Rectangular Door Handle::\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See <a href=\"/products/pryor-aluminum-pull-first-impressions-pry1smtsal\">Pryor Handle</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p>",
